venus 0129: sweetfilepatch takes more patches and a longer argument (16 patches, 512 chars)

The 7 activation patches already fill 196 of the 255 characters; an 8th patch (the dyld
shared cache) was silently cut off the argument.  Only the limits change.

diff --git a/bsd/dev/sweet_file_patch.c b/bsd/dev/sweet_file_patch.c
index 25dbfba..dc96e2f 100644
--- a/bsd/dev/sweet_file_patch.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/sweet_file_patch.c
@@ -42,10 +42,10 @@
 
 void sweet_filepatch_init(void);
 
-#define SFP_MAX_PATCH   8
+#define SFP_MAX_PATCH   16
 #define SFP_MAX_BYTES   16
 #define SFP_PATHLEN     160
-#define SFP_ARGLEN      256
+#define SFP_ARGLEN      512
